Instead of throwing a raw Error when validation fails, we should convert these shape and validation problems into stable validator warning/failure metadata to avoid throwing raw failures in validation scripts. Additionally, ensure we include both `missing_critical_fields` and `remote_write_fields` in the metadata.

```javascript
  const validation = validateFullBeta3530AttemptEvent(event);
  if (validation.status !== 'pass') {
    return {
      validation_status: 'fail',
      errors: [
        ...validation.missing_critical_fields,
        ...validation.remote_write_fields.map((field) => field + '_must_be_false'),
      ]
    };
  }
```

